[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2887.99, "timestamp": "00:48:07", "text": "哦，你真的这么做了，是的，我的确这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2890.55, "timestamp": "00:48:10", "text": "我当时就想，我刚才真的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2897.829, "timestamp": "00:48:17", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2900.47, "timestamp": "00:48:20", "text": "而我，这甚至算不上，这甚至算不上一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2901.91, "timestamp": "00:48:21", "text": "开玩笑。这是真实存在的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2904.67, "timestamp": "00:48:24", "text": "我也遇到过这种情况。我真的上去了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2908.349, "timestamp": "00:48:28", "text": "就像，然后他们俩都"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2911.51, "timestamp": "00:48:31", "text": "比如，“那样不好，别那样做。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2913.349, "timestamp": "00:48:33", "text": "我当时想：“为什么？这只是一根手指而已。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2915.349, "timestamp": "00:48:35", "text": "为什么？你好像在告诉我不要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2918.15, "timestamp": "00:48:38", "text": "那样做吗？”然后，后来我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2919.67, "timestamp": "00:48:39", "text": "他们意识到自己甚至没有纠正错误。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2921.109, "timestamp": "00:48:41", "text": "我。好的。那些兄弟没有没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2923.51, "timestamp": "00:48:43", "text": "即使纠正我，然后后来……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2925.589, "timestamp": "00:48:45", "text": "三四年后，我逐渐明白了什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2929.43, "timestamp": "00:48:49", "text": "这意味着我的天哪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2932.23, "timestamp": "00:48:52", "text": "所以，这就是滋补品的由来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2934.71, "timestamp": "00:48:54", "text": "我告诉你，要了解那些不好的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2936.87, "timestamp": "00:48:56", "text": "不要做这件事，但要了解其中的弊端。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2939.91, "timestamp": "00:48:59", "text": "如果有人走过来对你说，比如"}]